hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"34","[AI-translation] Hamein hadith sunayi Abu al-Mughira ne, hamein hadith sunayi 'Abdah ne, Khalid bin Ma'dan se, kehte hain: Jo shakhs Al-Kahf ki das aayatein parhega, woh Dajjal se khauf nahi khaayega."
"35","[AI-translation] An-Nawwas bin Sam'an al-Kilabi se riwayat hai, kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Dajjal ka zikr farmaya aur farmaya: Agar woh nikle aur main tum mein hoon toh main tumhare baghair uska muqaabla karunga, aur agar woh nikle aur main tum mein na hoon toh har shakhs apna khud muqaabla karega, aur Allah har musalman ka mera khaleefa hai. Pas tum mein se jis ko woh mil jaye, woh us par Surah Al-Kahf ki shuru aayatein parhe, kyunke woh uske fitne se tumhari panah hai. Hum ne kaha: Woh zameen mein kitni muddat rahega? Farmaya: Chalees din; ek din ek saal ke barabar, aur ek din ek mahine ke barabar, aur ek din ek jum'e ke barabar, aur baqi din tumhare dinon ke barabar. Hum ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah! Jo din ek saal ke barabar hoga, kya usmein ek din aur ek raat ki namaz kafi ho jayegi? Farmaya: Nahi, tum uske liye qadr muqarrar karo. Phir Isa bin Maryam Dimashq ke mashriqi safaid minaare ke paas utrenge aur usey Bab-e-Ludd ke paas paa kar qatl karenge."
"36","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Sa'id (radiyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Surah Al-Kahf jum'e ke din parhe, uske liye do jum'on ke darmiyan noor roshan kar diya jayega."
